# === Verible Waivers Configuration ===

# 1. Ignore EVERYTHING inside Vivado's auto-generated project folders
waive --rule=.* --location="project/.*"

# 2. Ignore line length restrictions in your testbenches (often long due to vectors/displays)
waive --rule=line-length --location="sim/.*"

# 3. Specific module waivers
# Example: If your MultiCycleMultiplier has some intentional blocking assignments
# waive --rule=always-ff-non-blocking --location="src/core/MultiCycleMultiplier.v"
